# ─── Recordings, screenshots, demo videos ─────────────────────────────────────
# Demo recordings, screen captures, and design exports are easy to commit by
# accident and bloat the repo. Anything in the directories below is private.
# Legitimate brand assets live under frontend/saalik-mobile/assets — those are
# explicitly re-allowed at the bottom of this file.
recordings/
screenshots/
demo-output/
investor-materials/
*.mov
*.mp4
*.webm
*.mkv
*.gif

# Re-allow committed brand/UI image assets (these *should* be in version control).
!frontend/saalik-mobile/assets/**

# ─── Confidential / private documents ─────────────────────────────────────────
# Anything that contains pricing, take rates, founder comp, partnership terms,
# or investor-specific framing. Use the suffix conventions, the `private/` dir,
# or the named-file list below.
AI_GUIDE_DESIGN.md
SOFT_LAUNCH_PLAN.md
DEMO_RECORDING_GUIDE.md
GROWTH_STRATEGY.md
INVESTOR_*.md
PITCH_*.md
DECK_*.md
CAP_TABLE*
*_CONFIDENTIAL.md
*_PRIVATE.md
*_INTERNAL.md
*_INVESTOR.md
private/
.private/
internal/
investors/

# ─── Agent / runtime output (Claude Code task transcripts, etc.) ──────────────
# These can leak conversation history and partial drafts.
tasks/
.tasks/
.agent-output/

# ─── Agentic memory / architect ledger (local source of truth, never commit) ──
.project_ledger.md
